## Playerstatus reset

settings.playerstatusreset.resetbutton:
    Reset mod config for this save slot (asks for confirmation)
settings.playerstatusreset.content.text:
    Resets your mod configurations for CURRENT SAVE SLOT which includes:
    - Leveling data -
    - Bench fast travel unlock + safety checks -
    (to prevent softlocks e.g. with Act 3 Abyss travel on new saves)
    
    <-- This will not reset your 'Extra Settings' values! -->
    
    Configs are save slot specific and loaded from an external file.
    Config data remains even if you start a new game on same save slot.
    This feature overrides only the config data for currently active slot so you don't need to manually search and edit/delete the file outside the game.
    
    You should only use this feature if you're done with your current playthrough and want to wipe all the progress for a fresh start.
settings.playerstatusreset.content.text2:
    Reset mod configurations for save slot {saveprofileid}?
settings.playerstatusreset.content.confirmbutton:
    Yes
    Reset config data
settings.playerstatusreset.content.cancelbutton:
    No
    Keep current data



